"NSHealthShareUsageDescription" = "OmniGart reads heart rate, HRV, sleep, workouts, active and resting energy, heart-rate recovery, workout effort, mindful minutes when you enable them, body mass, and related wellness samples from Apple Health so it can show readiness, recovery, and training estimates on your device. If a sample is later removed from Apple Health, OmniGart keeps your on-device copy. Health data stays on your devices and is never used for advertising or sold to third parties.";
"NSHealthUpdateUsageDescription" = "OmniGart writes strength, yoga, Pilates, and Zone 2 workouts — with duration, active and resting energy, heart rate, segments, and recovery or effort scores when available — plus optional mindful minutes for yoga and wellness metrics you choose to share into Apple Health so they appear in the Fitness app. Writes are append-only: OmniGart never deletes or rewrites Apple Health data, including workouts it created; later edits stay in OmniGart. Nothing is sent to advertisers or unrelated third parties.";
"NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription" = "OmniGart 使用蓝牙连接您选择的跑步机、心率带及类似健身配件，以便用实时速度、坡度、距离和心率样本改善设备上的健康估算。您也可以不连接任何配件继续使用应用。";
"NSCameraUsageDescription" = "OmniGart uses the camera only when you scan a food barcode to look up nutrition information. You can log food manually if you prefer not to allow camera access.";
"NSUserNotificationsUsageDescription" = "OmniGart can send reminders for workouts, hydration, and morning wellness check-ins you opt into. You can use the app fully with notifications turned off.";
